# 💬 OPIc Expression - Day26

## Today's Expression

### I didn't expect...

Meaning:

나는 ~할 거라고 예상하지 못했어요.

---

## When to Use

예상과 실제 상황이 달랐던 경험을 이야기할 때 사용한다.

OPIc에서 과거 경험을 자연스럽게 설명하기 좋은 표현이다.

---

## Examples

I didn't expect the restaurant to be so crowded.

I didn't expect the weather to change so quickly.

I didn't expect the trip to be so enjoyable.

---

## Useful Patterns

### I didn't expect + 명사 + to V

I didn't expect the hotel to be so expensive.

I didn't expect the trip to be so difficult.

---

### I didn't expect that + 문장

I didn't expect that the place would be so crowded.

---

